      "content_index_zero_based": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "text_en": "The Preliminary Phase establishes the security context required to guide the Security Architecture design. To build the security context, the following security artifacts need to be determined during this phase. These artifacts can be integrated into existing architecture documentation.",
