        "quote_en": "Table 3-2 provides an extended TOGAF Stakeholder Map including concern and requirement. Missing requirements within a concern can either be a gap in information gathering or a demonstration the stakeholder is saying “this does not matter”. Knowing requirement or lack of preference in relationship to power and interest directly facilitates trade-off. The trade-off is performed within a concern and between the concerns.",
        "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
        "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
