          "G186:p0036:b031",
          "G186:p0036:b032"
        ],
        "quote_en": "When establishing the EA Capability, it is likely common classes of stakeholder were identified. If this was done essential concerns were likely identified.[9] These concerns represent the questions that the EA Capability is expected to answer, and may be considered mandatory. Successful high-functioning EA teams will maintain a library of viewpoints (see Appendix C) designed to address the questions they are expected to have answers for. Each viewpoint should identify the concern, the stakeholder(s), how the view should be constructed, and the information required to address the question.",
        "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
        "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G186:3.3.1:rule04",
    "kind": "source-semantic-rule",
    "statement_zh": "视图说明架构如何回应关注点，不承诺相关需求全部被满足。",
    "boundary_zh": "模型、视角模板与已形成的视图分别管理；不能以“让利益相关者高兴”为验收标准。",
    "evidence": [
      {
        "source_unit_id": "G186:p0036:c008",
