          "quote_en": "Best practice has decisions on non-compliance being made by stakeholders. They need to approve the recommendation to enforce the target, grant relief, or change the architecture. Communication about compliance is very similar to trade-off conversations. Also, when relief is granted, further conversations about scheduling a roadmap or implementation plan update should also occur.",
          "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
          "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "G186:3.3.3:rule02",
      "kind": "source-semantic-rule",
      "statement_zh": "决策沟通必须说明路线图、完成变革、实现价值的置信程度。",
      "boundary_zh": "架构是近似表达，不能以生成完整材料掩盖不确定性。",
      "evidence": [
