            "G186:p0039:b013",
            "G186:p0039:b014"
          ],
          "quote_en": "Some of the most critical conversations with decision-makers are about confidence. The confidence they should have in the Roadmap and Implementation & Migration Plan, completing the change, and realizing the value. All architecture is an approximation; no Practitioner can underestimate the importance of confidence.",
          "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
          "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
        }
      ]
    }
