        "quote_en": "In a well-run EA Repository, the Standards Library will perform two functions. First, it provides a repository for the standards that the architecture must comply to. Second, it provides a repository for the standards imposed on all implementations by the architecture. The distinction is critical. One is used to test the architecture; the second is used to test an implementation.",
        "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
        "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
      }
    ]
