        ],
        "quote_en": "When Practitioners have a good architecture identifying the target and transition steps along the way, requirements, and architecture specifications, may vary over time; be different in the target and the transition architectures. Imagine a portfolio roadmap that deliberately sacrifices customer experience for agility in the first transition. Then in the second transition the priority switches and agility is sacrificed for customer experience. The conformance test to architecture requirement, and guidance on priority, switches. This document deliberately uses the term “sacrifice” because inherent in this requirements repository is clarity of precedence and priority. When clarity of precedence and priority is not available, data to guide trade-off early in the cycle is absent, hindering progress. Just as the assessment of precedence and priority shifts context to other decisions where a set of preferences are well defined and is closer to the organization most suited to make the choice.",
        "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
        "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G186:5.1.4:rule04",
    "kind": "source-semantic-rule",
    "statement_zh": "架构规格→需求→利益相关者/关注点的链路用于价值偏好治理。",
    "boundary_zh": "必须保留关系而非只有字段文本；也要检查注入需求与项目目的、上层架构是否一致。",
    "evidence": [
      {
        "source_unit_id": "G186:p0056:c003",
        "pdf_page": 56,
        "source_block_ids": [
          "G186:p0056:b026",
          "G186:p0056:b027",
          "G186:p0056:b028"
        ],
        "quote_en": "Explicitly link the architecture specification to requirements, and trace the requirements to a stakeholder/concern pair to track the value and preference. This traceability is used in governance to assess how well the design and implementation choices address the stakeholder’s value preferences.",
        "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
        "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
      }
    ]
  }
],
