          "quote_en": "Practitioners are most valuable facilitating trade-off between stakeholders and across organizational boundaries. This facilitation allows different stakeholders to effectively measure preferences, priorities, and costs that they do not intuitively understand. Best practice EA finds the best fit across competing preference, priority, and value. In facilitating the trade-off discussion, chase down all impacts and think through the end game needs. Work with the Enterprise risk management process to surface requisite dimensions. Think through all transition states. Leverage the architecture tool to handle the complexities of the EA Landscape and to accelerate the process.",
          "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
          "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
