6.3.5 批准
{
  "id": "G186:chapter-review:6.3.5",
  "source_section_id": "G186:s0070",
  "section_number": "6.3.5",
  "title_en": "6.3.5. Approval",
  "title_zh": "6.3.5 批准",
  "status": "source-compared-revised",
  "translation_mode": "revised-existing-translation",
  "pdf_pages": [
    80
  ],
  "translation_zh": "没有利益相关者的批准，就不可能有实施治理，也不可能有对更详细架构的治理。没有批准，实践者手里只是一份有记录的**意见**；而利益相关者、SME、实施者与决策者也都有意见。\n\n真正的批准是复杂的；真正的批准**应当**复杂。实践者是在协助组织，在一组随时间相互竞争的偏好中选出最佳可行路径。他们花时间探索了选项与影响。\n\n有了已批准的目标架构，未来就被定义，到目标的可追溯性就可用，权衡也已完成。好的架构权衡会探索选项、成本与收益，以达成对组织而言的最优答案——通常也是相互竞争利益之间的折衷。",
  "source_units": [
    {
      "id": "G186:p0080:c008",
      "pdf_page": 80,
      "content_index_zero_based": 8,
      "type": "heading",
      "text_en": "6.3.5. Approval",
      "source_block_ids": [
        "G186:p0080:b027"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        48.24,
        547.729,
        139.942,
        565.63
      ],
      "source_section_id": "G186:s0070"
    },
    {
      "id": "G186:p0080:c009",
      "pdf_page": 80,
      "content_index_zero_based": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "text_en": "Without approval by the stakeholders, no implementation governance is possible, and no governance of more detailed architecture is possible. Without approval, the Practitioner has a documented opinion. Stakeholders, SMEs, implementers, and decision-makers also have opinions.",
      "source_block_ids": [
        "G186:p0080:b028",
        "G186:p0080:b029",
        "G186:p0080:b030"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        48.24,
        575.88,
        563.76,
        621.72
      ],
      "source_section_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "G186:p0080:c010",
      "pdf_page": 80,
      "content_index_zero_based": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "text_en": "Real approval is complex. Real approval should be complex. The Practitioner is assisting their organization select the best possible path against a set of competing preferences over time. They have taken the time to explore options and impacts.",
      "source_block_ids": [
        "G186:p0080:b031",
        "G186:p0080:b032",
        "G186:p0080:b033"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        48.24,
        635.22,
        563.76,
        681.06
      ],
      "source_section_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "G186:p0080:c011",
      "pdf_page": 80,
      "content_index_zero_based": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "text_en": "With an approved Target Architecture, the future is defined, traceability to the objective is available, and trade-off has been performed. Good architecture trade-off explores options, cost, and benefits to reach the optimal answer for an organization; often a compromise between competing interests.",
      "source_block_ids": [
        "G186:p0080:b034",
        "G186:p0080:b035",
        "G186:p0080:b036"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        48.24,
        694.56,
        563.76,
        740.4
      ],
      "source_section_id": null
    }
  ],
