          "G186:p0132:b020",
          "G186:p0132:b021"
        ],
        "quote_en": "Basing all of the architectures on an implementation-neutral reference model allows impact of modifications to a specific architecture to be identified easily. As shown in Figure 13-1, the EA Repository tool could provide support to identify the change, whether it is to one of the attributes of an architectural component or a modification to the catalog of components. While working with a federated team, uses of such a tool and use of common reference models can go a long way to coordinate and communicate the impact of architecture changes. Within the roadmap, it is better to keep the analysis patterns consistent.",
        "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
        "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
      }
    ]
