    "id": "G186:13.2:rule02",
    "kind": "source-semantic-rule",
    "statement_zh": "路线图应标记短期效率损失、非预期次优和偏离，并报告规划期末得失与价值时间。",
    "boundary_zh": "短期负面变化可掩盖偏离，不能仅报告最终收益。",
    "evidence": [
      {
        "source_unit_id": "G186:p0133:c002",
        "pdf_page": 133,
        "source_block_ids": [
          "G186:p0133:b005",
          "G186:p0133:b006",
          "G186:p0133:b007",
          "G186:p0133:b008",
          "G186:p0133:b009"
        ],
        "quote_en": "When creating the roadmap, pay attention to impact of change. Any change, when introduced, will tarnish the efficiency, overall throughput, and sometimes call for duplicative investments. Such short- term negative impacts can mask deviations from the roadmap. Inject appropriate markers to identify any unintended sub-optimization or deviations from the roadmap. The value and outcome map should present the time to value and gain/loss at the end of the planning horizon.",
        "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G186e.pdf",
        "source_sha256": "ed1c26faba5023a8d1b32b0ec893d75a3bb1d7a6508e99fa56ded079585d922a"
      }
    ]
  }
