          ],
          "quote_en": "The management of a digitalized products and services portfolio and delivery model to enable the relevant Digital Products and Services is delivered fully digitally or obtained by the customer by digital means without impacting the overall Customer Experience. (Source: The DPBoK Standard [C196])",
          "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G21He.pdf",
