            "G21H:p0029:b008",
            "G21H:p0029:b009"
          ],
          "quote_en": "• Context III: Team of Teams – coordinating across the “team of teams” is a hard problem; too often, coordination mechanisms (such as overly process-centric operating models) degrade team cohesion and performance:",
