          ],
          "quote_en": "• Context IV: Enduring Enterprise – the thought experiment here is “the growing enterprise” and the establishment of additional feedback mechanisms for steering, managing risk, and assuring performance at scale and over increasing time horizons and increasingly complex ecosystems:",
