          "G21I:p0025:b016"
        ],
        "quote_en": "It should also be borne in mind that governance is not about developing a set of governance requirements, but rather the process and approach to apply them. Following the Agile principles, governance should become an ongoing activity performed by the architects working side-by-side with implementation teams.",
        "source_path": "togaf-standard-10th/G21Ie.pdf",
        "source_sha256": "279f6c06124f49a147a168591965805115b2fc976eea2664e41e491ac5d163bf"
