      "content_index_zero_based": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "text_en": "The BI & Analytics capability refers to the people, processes, organizations, and systems put together to create value-added information from relevant decision-making data of the organization. This capability breaks applicative data siloes and allows the structuring and leveraging of data according to decision-making and analytics use cases. It includes business value, data quality, availability, and security to deliver the required common data to relevant reporting or analytics use cases.",
