  "title_en": "3.8.1. Manage Digital Equipment Inventories",
  "title_zh": "管理数字设备清单",
  "status": "source-compared-revised",
  "translation_mode": "retained-and-revised-after-source-comparison",
  "pdf_pages": [
    73
  ],
  "translation_zh": "组织所需数字设备的准确清单，是环境影响度量的基础之一。它应覆盖服务器与网络设备，也应覆盖显示器、笔记本电脑、台式机、平板电脑、智能手机、会议室视频设备、外设（键盘、鼠标、耳机等）、打印机、电视屏幕等。清单可以通过自动方式（针对联网设备）、通过采购与发票，或人工方式维护。ICT 资产清单管理是配置管理数据库（CMDB）的职能之一。",
  "source_units": [
    {
      "id": "G242:p0073:c005",
      "pdf_page": 73,
      "content_index_zero_based": 5,
      "type": "heading",
      "text_en": "3.8.1. Manage Digital Equipment Inventories",
      "source_block_ids": [
        "G242:p0073:b018"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        48.24,
        371.169,
        319.355,
        389.07
      ],
      "source_section_id": "G242:s0059"
    },
    {
      "id": "G242:p0073:c006",
      "pdf_page": 73,
      "content_index_zero_based": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "text_en": "An accurate inventory of digital equipment required by the organization is one of the foundations of the environmental impact measure. It should cover servers and network equipment, but also monitors, laptops, desktops, tablets, smartphones, meeting room video equipment, peripherals (keyboards, mice, headphones, etc.), printers, TV screens, etc. Inventories can be maintained automatically (for connected devices), through purchasing and invoices, or manually. ICT asset inventory management is one of the functions of a Configuration Management Database (CMDB).",
