支持延长数字设备的使用期限
{
  "id": "G242:chapter-review:3.8.2",
  "source_section_id": "G242:s0060",
  "section_number": "3.8.2",
  "title_en": "3.8.2. Support the Increase in Usage Period of Digital Equipment",
  "title_zh": "支持延长数字设备的使用期限",
  "status": "source-compared-revised",
  "translation_mode": "retained-and-revised-after-source-comparison",
  "pdf_pages": [
    73
  ],
  "translation_zh": "延长数字设备的使用期限，还要求改变“总是购买更时尚、性能更好的全新设备，然后丢弃旧设备”的习惯。对企业而言，这意味着为设备保护与维修投入更多资源。维修意味着为服务台与技术员工建立能力与文化，使他们有能力也有意愿处理基本的常见问题，例如更换电池或维修屏幕。",
  "source_units": [
    {
      "id": "G242:p0073:c007",
      "pdf_page": 73,
      "content_index_zero_based": 7,
      "type": "heading",
      "text_en": "3.8.2. Support the Increase in Usage Period of Digital Equipment",
      "source_block_ids": [
        "G242:p0073:b025"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        48.24,
        508.919,
        445.442,
        526.82
      ],
      "source_section_id": "G242:s0060"
    },
    {
      "id": "G242:p0073:c008",
      "pdf_page": 73,
      "content_index_zero_based": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "text_en": "Increasing the usage period of digital equipment also requires changes to the habit of always buying brand new equipment, which is more fashionable and better performing, and then dispose of old devices. For enterprises, this means dedicating more resources to equipment protection and repair. Repairing means creating the ability and culture for the help desk and technical employees to have the ability and willingness to tackle basic recurrent problems, like changing batteries or repairing screens.",
      "source_block_ids": [
        "G242:p0073:b026",
        "G242:p0073:b027",
